1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,900
[dramatic music playing]

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,900
- [gasps]
- Who's there?

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,900
JOHN: I told you not to come here.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,900
<i>[door creaks]</i>
Hello?

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,900
- MAN (on phone): We have a problem.
- (sighs) Of course we do.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,900
♪ upbeat pop music playing ♪

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,900
♪ Walking down the street
on a sunny afternoon ♪

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,900
Wait, [coughs] hold on.

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,900
[man speaking
indistinctly]

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,900
It's 10:30. We're late.

11
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,900
{\an8}[gunshot in background]

12
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,900
- Get down!
- [screaming]

13
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,900
<i>NARRATOR: Long ago,
in a land far away...</i>

14
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,900
♪♪

15
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,900
(LAUGHS)

16
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,900
- Hi.
- [chuckles] Hello.

17
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,900
DR. SMITH: The results are in.

18
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,900
[in Spanish] ¿Dónde está?

19
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,900
- [grunts]
- Hey, are you
all right?

20
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,500
I said no: absolutely not.
